{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left\">台積電上月營業收入，按月微跌。</p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left\">較8月跌幅不足百分之1，達到5,118億新台幣，按年則增長五成四。綜合首三季，營業收入近3.9萬億元新台幣，按年增長四成一。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-08T12:58:54.161737+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":78,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}